---
description: Prepare one modelNarrativeInformation evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: AccessibleProduction[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Read the script and approved scene metadata to identify dialogue, sound, visual information, and narrative reveals. Distinguish essential understanding from decorative detail and preserve what the audience is meant to know at each moment. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
